<title>UK: Two Brent cargoes kept, third clocked - trade.</title>
<headline>Two Brent cargoes kept, third clocked - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two Brent cargoes nominated loading dates on Friday were kept ahead of the five o'clock deadline while the third was unclaimed, traders said.</p>
<p>The cargo loading Nov 9-11 was clocked to British Petroleum, while others loading Nov 10-12 and Nov 11-13 were kept by U.S. refiner Koch and Wall Street trader J.P. Morgan respectively, they said.</p>
<p>The Nov 9-11 was the first Brent cargo to be clocked this week.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7930</p>
